sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser
  participant Nuxt as Nuxt server route
  participant API as Rust server
  participant Store as Session cookie
  Browser->>Nuxt: Request protected page
  Nuxt->>Store: Read access and refresh cookies
  Nuxt->>API: Fetch authenticated data
  alt Access token valid
    API-->>Nuxt: Return user data
  else Access token expired
    Nuxt->>API: POST auth/web/refresh
    API-->>Nuxt: Rotated access and refresh cookies
    Nuxt->>Store: Update cookies on response
    Nuxt->>API: Retry authenticated request
    API-->>Nuxt: Return user data
  end
  Nuxt-->>Browser: Render protected page
